# DITA-OT plugins. pdf-theme is this book's own customisation of the PDF
# output and is tracked here: it is the only copy, and install-pdf-theme.sh
# builds the installed plugin from it. Only en.xml used to be kept, which left
# the layout and typography outside version control. The syntax-highlighting
# plugin comes from elsewhere and is not ours to keep.
pdf-theme-syntax-highlight/
pdf-theme-syntax-highlight.zip

